  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Horn Section Setup** (1 review): A pause for the horn section to set up, with an introduction, came before Cannonball [2]\n- **Tuesday Night Squad** (1 review): Longest piece of the show at about 22 minutes 45 seconds [2]\n- The unidentified vocal tune with N'Dambi is Day Dreamer [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Horn Section Setup**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [4]\n- **Cut By Management**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2002-08-10.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 112 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The festival cut the set off at the end, leaving only a short final segment of about four minutes [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2002-08-10.shnf**: taped by Pat Kelly; transferred by Pat Kelly; source: Oktava MC012->MP-2->d10 [1]. Also: All taping and transfers were done by Pat Kelly, an archive.org user [1]",
